<title>USA: NYC $834 mln GO bonds yield 6.18 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>NYC $834 mln GO bonds yield 6.18 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
